Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:05.98,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Takatsuki... kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:12.38,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:16.99,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,It's you, Takatsuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:21.00,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Is that you, Sasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.87,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:24.48,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,What's going on with this lamia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.97,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I'll blast her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.44,top,Lucy,0,0,0,,O Goddess Sol, protector \Nof life who governs flame,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:28.13,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Lucy, Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.56,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You'll burn me with her, remember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:31.37,top,Lucy,0,0,0,,today is the day of beginnings,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.52,top,Lucy,0,0,0,,the day of genesis whence you pronounced,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:33.52,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.89,top,Lucy,0,0,0,,let there be flames burning \Namidst the silence and chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.89,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sasan is a human from \Nanother world like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:39.01,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,She's clearly a monster, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:45.64,top,Lucy,0,0,0,,O Goddess, let the sacred flame lit \Nby your voice be recalled here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.80,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I know that's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:42.39,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,but just calm down for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.76,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:24.95,top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7\NMAKOTO TAKATSUKI\N HELPS WITH HER REVENGE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:30.48,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Takatsuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:31.47,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:33.50,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,How long are you going to cling to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:38.80,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sasan, your appearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.72,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:41.78,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Human disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:44.64,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:46.15,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:48.14,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Hey, at least put on some clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:50.27,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Also, what's going on with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.64,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,It's a spell to look human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.98,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,It's used when hunting humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.53,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:02:59.84,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.57,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I'm not lending it for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.15,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Lucy, this is Aya Sasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:09.91,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Lucy-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:12.00,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.67,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Also, aren't you a \Nlittle too close to Makoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.67,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,We haven't seen each other in forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:17.80,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,so what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:18.75,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:21.18,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Are you Takatsuki-kun's \Ngirlfriend or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:22.93,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.19,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Then there's no issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:29.18,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,More importantly, \Nwhy are you a lamia, Sasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:31.50,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! It's quite a story!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:33.19,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,After that accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:36.63,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:40.04,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,So you're the first among \Nyour sisters to hatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:41.93,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:44.59,flashback,AyaM,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.72,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,My sweet child,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.83,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,let me see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.03,flashback italics,AyaM,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:02.65,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,My, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:05.43,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,It looks likes your sisters \Nare waking up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:11.10,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,When I came to, I had become a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:13.82,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,No wonder you weren't in the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:16.96,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,So some people reincarnated as \Nthings other than humans, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.86,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I was surprised, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:24.12,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,After that, I grew up in harmony with \Nmy great mother and my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:27.24,flashback,Sister,0,0,0,,Great Mother, we've acquired \Na high-quality meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:36.02,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Oh, my. This is a lively one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.01,flashback italics,Aya,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:51.11,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:53.27,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,That's an awfully big haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:56.82,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,I see. Your stats are high, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:57.52,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:05:01.40,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Because of that, the other girls \Nget attacked by enemies less often.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.73,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,You're such a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.28,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.03,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I was hesitant at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:13.41,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,but I came to like my kind \Nfamily more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:15.41,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:22.00,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Why?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:24.67,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,You all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:27.90,flashback,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,My, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:31.18,flashback,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,You seem fine in this cold air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:33.13,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:37.88,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,I've been fighting with you \Nfor over three hundred years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.99,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,That finally comes to an end today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.07,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Go ahead and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.32,flashback,LamiaMom,0,0,0,,Witness your mother's final moments!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.59,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.33,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Great Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:08.34,flashback,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Yes, what a pretty-colored heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.61,flashback,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Now, that just leaves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:28.88,flashback,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Go ahead and freeze this girl, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:40.37,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,In the end, I was killed \Nby the harpy queen as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:46.13,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:50.43,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,I thought I had it the hardest \Nsince coming to this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:53.17,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,but I've been playing on \Neasy mode compared to Sasan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.64,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.73,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,You're alive right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:57.84,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:07:00.00,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm positive that I died,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.58,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,but here I am, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:05.28,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,It makes me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:09.90,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,that I must have been brought \Nback to life for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.24,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,After that, I've hunted, and hunted,\N and hunted as many monsters as I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:17.74,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Until I met Takatsuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:19.32,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You went through all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:21.17,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:21.92,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.95,0:07:28.07,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,Ah! I died!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.44,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Takatsuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:31.33,flashback,Makoto,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.72,flashback,Makoto,0,0,0,,Do you want to play a different game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.68,flashback,Aya,0,0,0,,No, one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.88,flashback,Makoto,0,0,0,,All right, time for your revenge match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:42.47,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I want to grow stronger\N and avenge my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.56,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,In that case, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.85,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I'll blast all of them away, Aya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:51.20,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.12,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,You'll help too, right, Makoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:54.94,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:56.07,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.65,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.65,0:07:59.30,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Now that that's settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:01.36,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'd like to return to\N town for a bit, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.71,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Do you know a way out of here, Sasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:04.88,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.42,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:09.46,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I bet Fujiyan and Nina-san are \Nworried too, so let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:12.84,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Tackie-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.72,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,I'm sure those two will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.81,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:19.91,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Tackie-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:21.08,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Lucy-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.64,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,You're both safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:23.60,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:24.88,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:26.98,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Is that you, Sasaki-dono?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.36,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.86,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,You've been through an awful lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:36.69,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,So Lucy and I are planning to \Nhelp Sasan out with her revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.47,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,In that case, allow us to help as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:40.33,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.87,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:44.96,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,However, harpies are rather powerful foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:48.50,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Taking on a whole flock is \Ntougher than facing a griffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.01,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Oh, it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.50,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,The queen is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.88,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,but even I can defeat ordinary harpies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.28,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:59.44,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Are you really just an \Nordinary lamia, Sasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:00.14,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.24,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:04.19,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! I've been curious about that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:06.70,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Sounds like a job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.15,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.65,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Aya Sasaki-dono...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:13.30,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Your level is 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:18.41,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Your unique skills are Transformation, \NEvolution, and Action Game Player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.39,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Level 34?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:22.46,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,That's incredibly high.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.58,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,It's higher than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:28.00,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,That Action Game Player \Nskill sounds kind of cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:33.21,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Apparently, it lets you use Dash, \NCharge Attack, and Double Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:34.19,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:35.30,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.18,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,"Extra Lives: 4"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:38.16,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:40.33,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:49.27,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,I heard through the grapevine that the \NSoleil Knights led by Sakurai-dono
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:52.23,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,defeated the blight dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:53.65,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.53,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,That's the Hero of Light for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:56.62,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:59.16,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Sakurai-kun is the Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.00,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.41,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:05.41,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,By the way, it sounds like \Nthat's not all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:06.91,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:10.50,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,They say there are still \Ntwo more blight dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:12.19,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Huh?! Two more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:16.05,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Then the monsters are still going to \Nremain active in the great labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:18.80,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I guess it's still impossible \Nto get my revenge, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:25.01,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to execute a plan after \Nthe monsters have settled down, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:29.69,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,No, let's prepare to defeat \Nthe harpies as things stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:34.19,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'll befriend the elementals of the great \Nlabyrinth to enhance my elemental magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:37.39,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sasan, you focus on learning \Nthe Stealth skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:38.59,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:39.32,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:42.23,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You're going to be the \Nkeystone of this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:43.58,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.65,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:47.90,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Thanks to the titanea, \Nyou're able to use ground magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:52.08,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,and we'll hit the harpies with that after \Nimbuing it with fire, their weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:53.84,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Well? Think you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.32,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll try!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.18,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,How long do you think \Nit'll take to get it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:10:59.84,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I think three days will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:04.15,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Then let's plan to carry out \Nour big battle in four days!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:35.06,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,You're lacking dignity as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:37.76,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,I wish you would act more\Nappropriately towards your believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.50,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:44.75,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I managed to meet Sasan \Nthanks to your revelation, Noah-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:46.14,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:49.22,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If you're grateful, then that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:52.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Setting that aside,\NAya Sasaki is nice, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:54.56,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Her stats are on par with the Hero's!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.27,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.96,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Lucy's been working hard, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:01.78,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,so your party is starting \Nto come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.87,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:05.00,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Though I'm still weak myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.25,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Stats are just for show!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.56,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You have your elemental magic, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.42,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You just need a move that \Ncan turn the tables!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.79,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:17.39,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Oh, right, Makoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:20.16,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Make sure you're friends \Nwith the Hero of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:24.01,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sakurai-kun is a believer of \Nthe sacred deities you hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.49,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You sure I should \Nbe getting close to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.30,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that. \NDon't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:30.43,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able \Nto make good use of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:34.99,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I want to be \Nblatantly {\i1}using{\i0} my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:38.52,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Quit complaining, and get \Nclose to him like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:39.41,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:40.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.19,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,There's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:45.52,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up for your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:50.20,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Even a goddess lazes about and wears \Nsomething casual from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.58,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You should let yourself \Nrelax a bit more, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:57.78,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Is that why you wore that today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:13:00.46,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Did it help you relax a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:03.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Listen, you should be yourself \Nand live your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:06.97,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You have the powerful will \Nto see anything through,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:10.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and the talent to turn \Nfailures into big wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:11.60,top,sign,0,0,0,,BIG WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:16.48,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Noah-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:17.59,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:24.79,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,I'll move forward on\N the matter we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:27.99,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Let's each do our best in our \Nrespective areas as we planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:28.88,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.12,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Fujiyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:31.97,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You can wait for the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.50,Default,Fujiyan,0,0,0,,Then I wish you luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.55,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,The woods are creepy at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.16,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Harpies can't see at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.27,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,so we'll have the advantage in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:43.16,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:48.26,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Aya? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:50.02,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:52.05,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I'll take down every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.06,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.94,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I understand feeling anxious \Nwith your enemy before us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:00.02,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,but let's relax a little as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.92,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,We're fully prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:07.53,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,So let's stay calm so we can\N use our strength to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.53,0:14:09.14,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.96,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,I said something very unlike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.04,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,Though I got it from Noah-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.68,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,This fog is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:23.44,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I asked the elementals to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:24.00,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.01,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Over this wide area?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:25.92,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,All of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:30.01,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I wonder if this will go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.65,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:32.59,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:33.43,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.93,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,First, we'll take out their lookouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:43.69,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.57,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,Calm Mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.98,italics,MakotoM,0,0,0,,One left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:04.96,italics,LucyM,0,0,0,,I'll be the decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:06.43,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:22.14,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,That went quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:23.43,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:24.30,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:30.17,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sasan and\N Nina-san are ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:31.61,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.80,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Okay, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:38.12,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I'll give them an extra big \Ntaste of my magic for Aya, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.29,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:41.00,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.85,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:47.50,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:48.95,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.51,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Wreathe it in fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:58.26,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Imbue Flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:07.33,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Boulder Bullet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.33,0:16:10.13,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Meteor Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.31,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:21.02,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:22.66,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.29,italics,AyaM,0,0,0,,This is vengeance for my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.43,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:30.29,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I won't let even a single one escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:32.57,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,I don't see the queen, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:35.04,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Where could she be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:42.80,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Have you found the harpy queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:44.19,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:47.18,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Maybe my spell got her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:52.00,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Takatsuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:52.61,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:16:59.92,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:02.50,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,You went on an awful \Nrampage here, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:04.62,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Harpy queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.70,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I've killed your entire family!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:10.25,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,You're the only one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:11.50,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:15.26,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Now that I get a good look,\Nyou're that lamia who died so pitifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.56,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,I don't know how you're alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.82,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,but I'll kill you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:24.52,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Also, as long as I'm alive, those girls \Nwill come back to life again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.14,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:28.40,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:30.34,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,that means if we defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:32.40,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,then the harpies are wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:38.05,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Do you four think you can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:42.67,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,A song?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.48,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Is she showing off how little she cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:47.92,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,It's Siren's Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:52.30,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Any man who hears this song will be \Ncharmed and fall under her control!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.65,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:18:00.92,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Place your dagger to your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:03.36,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Makoto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:06.07,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Yes, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:09.81,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Now go hurt those impudent little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.57,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Takatsuki-kun! Get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.33,italics,Lucy,0,0,0,,If we don't defeat her,\Nhe won't go back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.53,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Whoa, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:34.32,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,If any of your allies try to attack me, \Nthen slit your own throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.72,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Throw down your staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.47,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,We can't act carelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:44.97,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Now come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:56.11,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:01.86,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Go on, lick my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.87,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,This is your goddess's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:04.87,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Makoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:14.88,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,My goddess's foot\Nwould never be so filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.51,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,You! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:18.92,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Sasan! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:24.43,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,You impudent brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:25.56,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,I'll rip you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:31.31,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Don't touch Sasan with your filthy hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:33.61,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Harpy queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:39.94,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,This is for Great Mother \Nand everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:41.70,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,This time I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.81,0:19:50.58,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:57.84,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,What incredible vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.21,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:02.09,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,you'll die if your heart \Nis crushed, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:03.84,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:07.65,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Now pay for what you did to Great Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:08.60,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.82,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,You die now, harpy queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:14.48,Default,HarpyQueen,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.99,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,I did it, Great Mother. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.23,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.25,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,It feels like my strength has left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:33.37,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:34.41,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:36.00,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Thank you, Takatsuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:38.16,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,All of you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:43.40,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:44.98,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,They're magicite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:47.21,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Both of them look very valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:51.52,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Holding this magicite feels calming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:56.00,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Maybe that's the magicite \Nfrom your great mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:56.65,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:21:00.09,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why it's calming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:04.37,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Is it... okay if I keep this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:06.17,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,I think that's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:07.53,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.12,Default,Nina,0,0,0,,I think my master would say the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:10.41,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:13.29,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:15.41,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,I'm glad it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:17.11,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, Takatsuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.11,0:21:18.00,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:19.04,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Aren't you too close?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.04,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.05,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.05,top,Makoto,0,0,0,,Both of you, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.05,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:25.05,top,Nina,0,0,0,,Everyone! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:30.31,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,There's an incredibly \Nstrong monster nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.67,Default,Lucy,0,0,0,,Isn't that the Hero of Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:41.32,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.39,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:55.96,Default,Aya,0,0,0,,What is this voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:58.78,Default,Makoto,0,0,0,,A blight dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:00.14,italics,Makoto,0,0,0,,Hey, come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:02.43,italics,Makoto,0,0,0,,he's clearly in a pinch there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.98,top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 8\NMAKOTO TAKATSUKI\NSPEAKS TO THE ELEMENTALS

